    en: Not enough repair materials. The first engine repair costs 3 iron plates; later repairs are free.
    fragment: 1
  - key: copy.088
    zh: "\u6D77\u6C34\u8FC7\u6EE4\u5668\u4FEE\u590D\uFF0C\u53CC\u65B9\u79FB\u52A8\u901F\u5EA6\u6C38\u4E45\u63D0\u534710%\u3002"
    en: Water filter repaired. Both crew members permanently move 10% faster.
