    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.ship
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u8239\u8236\u72B6\u6001\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved ship state is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.crew
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u8239\u5458\u72B6\u6001\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved crew state is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.pipes
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u5BFC\u6D41\u62FC\u56FE\u6570\u636E\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved pipe puzzle is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.enemies
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u654C\u4EBA\u6570\u636E\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved enemy data is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.enemy.config
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u654C\u4EBA\u4F4D\u7F6E\u6216\u6570\u91CF\u4E0E\u5F53\u524D\u914D\u7F6E\u4E0D\u517C\u5BB9\u3002"
    en: The saved enemy positions or count do not match the current configuration.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.format
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u683C\u5F0F\u6216\u7248\u672C\u4E0D\u53D7\u652F\u6301\u3002"
    en: This save format or version is not supported.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.cargo.type
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u8D27\u7269\u7C7B\u578B\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The save contains an invalid cargo item type.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.cargo
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u8D27\u7269\u6570\u636E\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved cargo data is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.repairs
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u89D2\u8272\u4E0E\u7EF4\u4FEE\u6570\u636E\u4E0D\u5B8C\u6574\u3002"
    en: Crew or repair data is missing from the save.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.winch
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u7EDE\u76D8\u76EE\u6807\u4E0D\u5B58\u5728\u3002"
    en: The saved winch target is missing.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.economy
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u7ECF\u6D4E\u6570\u636E\u4E0D\u5B8C\u6574\u3002"
    en: Inventory or upgrade data is missing from the save.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.gate
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u95E8\u6570\u636E\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved trapdoor data is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.gate.id
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u95E8ID\u4E0E\u5F53\u524D\u5730\u56FE\u751F\u6210\u5668\u4E0D\u517C\u5BB9\uFF1A"
    en: 'The saved trapdoor ID does not match the current generator: '
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.recipe
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u914D\u65B9\u4E0D\u5B58\u5728\uFF1A"
    en: 'A saved recipe is missing: '
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.quest
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u4EFB\u52A1\u6570\u636E\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved quest data is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.calendar
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u65E5\u671F\u4E0E\u5F53\u524D\u663C\u591C\u914D\u7F6E\u4E0D\u517C\u5BB9\u3002"
    en: The saved date does not match the current day and night configuration.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.devices
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u8BBE\u5907\u72B6\u6001\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved equipment state is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.upgrades
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u5347\u7EA7\u7B49\u7EA7\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved upgrade levels are invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.time
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u65F6\u95F4\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved time is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.world
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u4E16\u754C\u6570\u636E\u4E0D\u5B8C\u6574\u3002"
    en: World data is missing from the save.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.world.seed
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u4E16\u754C\u79CD\u5B50\u4E0E\u5F53\u524D\u5730\u56FE\u914D\u7F6E\u4E0D\u517C\u5BB9\u3002"
    en: The saved world seed does not match the current map configuration.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.projectiles
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u6295\u5C04\u7269\u6570\u636E\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved projectile data is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.puzzle
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u7EF4\u4FEE\u5C0F\u6E38\u620F\u6570\u636E\u4E0D\u5B8C\u6574\u3002"
    en: Repair puzzle data is missing from the save.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.size
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u6587\u4EF6\u8FC7\u5927\uFF0C\u65E0\u6CD5\u8BFB\u53D6\u3002"
    en: The save file is too large to read.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.amount
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u7269\u8D44\u6570\u91CF\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved material amounts are invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.pickup.id
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u7269\u8D44ID\u4E0E\u5F53\u524D\u5730\u56FE\u751F\u6210\u5668\u4E0D\u517C\u5BB9\uFF1A"
    en: 'The saved pickup ID does not match the current generator: '
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.checksum
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u6821\u9A8C\u5931\u8D25\u3002\u539F\u6587\u4EF6\u548C\u5907\u4EFD\u5747\u672A\u4FEE\u6539\u3002"
    en: Save verification failed. The original file and backup were preserved.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.faults
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u5F15\u64CE\u6545\u969C\u6570\u636E\u4E0D\u5B8C\u6574\u3002"
    en: Engine fault data is missing from the save.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.combat
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u6218\u6597\u6570\u636E\u4E0D\u5B8C\u6574\u3002"
    en: Combat data is missing from the save.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.queue
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u5236\u4F5C\u961F\u5217\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: The saved crafting queue is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.job
    zh: "\u5B58\u6863\u4F5C\u4E1A\u6570\u636E\u65E0\u6548\u3002"
    en: A saved crafting job is invalid.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.phase
    zh: "\u5F53\u524D\u72B6\u6001\u4E0D\u80FD\u4FDD\u5B58\u3002"
    en: The game cannot be saved in its current state.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.continue
    zh: "\u8BFB\u6863\u5931\u8D25\uFF1A"
    en: 'Could not load the game: '
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.read
    zh: "\u8BFB\u53D6\u5B58\u6863\u5931\u8D25\uFF1A"
    en: 'Could not read the save: '
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.restore
    zh: "\u6062\u590D\u5B58\u6863\u5931\u8D25\uFF1A"
    en: 'Could not restore the save: '
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.manual.complete
    zh: "\u624B\u52A8\u5B58\u6863\u5DF2\u4FDD\u5B58\u3002"
    en: Game saved.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.missing
    zh: "\u672A\u627E\u5230\u5B58\u6863\u3002"
    en: No save was found.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.session
    zh: "\u672A\u627E\u5230\u6E38\u620F\u4F1A\u8BDD\u3002"
    en: No game session was found.
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.error.write
    zh: "\u5199\u5165\u5B58\u6863\u5931\u8D25\uFF1A"
    en: 'Could not write the save: '
    fragment: 1
  - key: save.auto.complete
    zh: "\u5DF2\u5B8C\u6210\u4ECA\u65E5\u81EA\u52A8\u5B58\u6863\u3002"
    en: Today's automatic save is complete.
    fragment: 1
